      "author": "A Robot",
      "institution": "MTSU",
      "dateCreated": "2026-07-10",
      "educationalObjectives": [
        "Describe the apparent path of Mars across the night sky during a retrograde episode.",
        "Understand the historical context of the geocentric epicycle model used to explain this observation."
