          "clipName": "m2_clip1_orbits",
          "autoAdvance": false,
          "changeMeaning": "Introduce the heliocentric model with Earth and Mars orbiting the Sun at different speeds.",
          "narration": "Now, let's step outside the solar system and view the Sun-centered, or heliocentric, model. Earth and Mars both orbit the Sun, but Earth, being on the inner track, moves faster. Notice how smoothly they travel\u2014no epicycles required!"
        },
