          "changeMeaning": "Speed up the orbits to emphasize the moment Earth overtakes Mars.",
          "narration": "Watch what happens when Earth overtakes Mars. Just like passing a slower car on the highway, the slower object appears to drift backward relative to the distant background. This relative motion naturally produces the apparent retrograde loop we saw from Earth. This simpler explanation is preferred due to parsimony."
        },
