          "changeMeaning": "Enable Jupiter to demonstrate the effect of distance on retrograde motion.",
          "narration": "What about planets further out, like Jupiter and Saturn? Because they are much further from the Sun, the parallax effect from Earth overtaking them is smaller. As a result, their retrograde loops appear narrower and less dramatic in the night sky."
